    "detailed_description": "<strong>Uncover 15 uncensored images by solving puzzles to remove blockers!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178690/extras/dadde2e8dc7e277a73fbdebdfbe17ddd.poster.avif?t=1573318535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178690/extras/dadde2e8dc7e277a73fbdebdfbe17ddd.webm?t=1573318535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178690/extras/dadde2e8dc7e277a73fbdebdfbe17ddd.mp4?t=1573318535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Solve the puzzles by coloring the maze with your ball! The ball doesn't stop or change direction until it hits a wall. Use your arrow keys to launch the ball in a direction!<br><br>There is no time limit or max moves, just relax and have fun! But be careful, sometimes your first move has to be strategic.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178690/extras/a62f0033ec3ca7c67e54b5e42852b755.poster.avif?t=1573318535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178690/extras/a62f0033ec3ca7c67e54b5e42852b755.webm?t=1573318535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178690/extras/a62f0033ec3ca7c67e54b5e42852b755.mp4?t=1573318535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Each solved puzzle removes a blocked portion of your image, revealing some juicy Hentai underneath!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178690/extras/PeekGrid.PNG?t=1573318535\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Worried about having to solve all the images just to see an image that interests you?</h2>You can work on any of the images at any time! Feel like jumping around? Go ahead! Having trouble with a puzzle? Take a break and work on another image! Each image has one portion visible to give you a little idea of what is hidden away.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pop 20 hidden sloths throughout the puzzles to unlock achievements!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 Uncensored Images<br></li><li>165 Relaxing Puzzles<br></li><li>69 Achievements<br></li><li>Fun Puzzle Gameplay<br></li><li>Gallery of your Unlocked Images<br></li><li>20 Hidden Sloth Achievements<br></li><li>Relaxing Music<br></li><li>Partial Controller Support</li></ul>",
